:"pd_martin_great_day","line":64,"path":"gitignore/lyric_video_pictures/bsb_REV_6/pd_martin_great_day.png","start":null}],"lines":[{"text":"Then I watched as the Lamb opened"},{"text":"one of the seven seals,"},{"text":"and I heard one of the four living creatures"},{"text":"say in a thunderous voice, Come!"},{"text":"So I looked and saw a white horse,"},{"text":"and its rider held a bow."},{"text":"And he was given a crown,"},{"text":"and he rode out to overcome and conquer."},{"text":"And when the Lamb opened the second seal,"},{"text":"I heard the second living creature say, Come!"},{"text":"Then another horse went forth."},{"text":"It was bright red,"},{"text":"and its rider was granted permission"},{"text":"to take away peace from the earth"},{"text":"and to make men slay one another."},{"text":"And he was given a great sword."},{"text":"And when the Lamb opened the third seal,"},{"text":"I heard the third living creature say, Come!"},{"text":"Then I looked and saw a black horse,"},{"text":"and its rider held in his hand a pair of scales."},{"text":"And I heard what sounded like a voice"},{"text":"from among the four living creatures, saying,"},{"text":"A quart of wheat for a denarius,"},{"text":"and three quarts of barley for a denarius,"},{"text":"and do not harm the oil"},{"text":"and the wine."},{"text":"And when the Lamb opened the fourth seal,"},{"text":"I heard the voice of the fourth living creature say, Come!"},{"text":"Then I looked and saw a pale green horse."},{"text":"Its rider's name was Death,"},{"text":"and Hades followed close behind."},{"text":"And they were given authority over a fourth of the earth,"},{"text":"to kill by sword, by famine,"},{"text":"by plague, and by the beasts of the earth."},{"text":"And when the Lamb opened the fifth seal,"},{"text":"I saw under the altar the souls of those"},{"text":"who had been slain for the word of God"},{"text":"and for the testimony they had upheld."},{"text":"And they cried out in a loud voice,"},{"text":"How long, O Lord, holy and true,"},{"text":"until You avenge our blood"},{"text":"and judge those who dwell upon the earth?"},{"text":"Then each of them was given a white robe"},{"text":"and told to rest a little while longer,"},{"text":"until the full number of their fellow servants,"},{"text":"their brothers, were killed just as they had been."},{"text":"And when I saw the Lamb open the sixth seal,"},{"text":"there was a great earthquake,"},{"text":"and the sun became black like sackcloth of goat hair,"},{"text":"and the whole moon turned blood red,"},{"text":"and the stars of the sky fell to the earth"},{"text":"like unripe figs dropping from a tree"},{"text":"shaken by a great wind."},{"text":"The sky receded like a scroll being rolled up,"},{"text":"and every mountain and island"},{"text":"was moved from its place."},{"text":"Then the kings of the earth, the nobles,"},{"text":"the commanders, the rich, the mighty,"},{"text":"and every slave and free man hid in the caves"},{"text":"and among the rocks of the mountains."},{"text":"And they said to the mountains and the rocks,"},{"text":"Fall on us and hide us"},{"text":"from the face of the One seated on the throne,"},{"text":"and from the wrath of the Lamb."},{"text":"For the great day of Their wrath has come,"},{"text":"and who is able to withstand it?"}]}
